class=\"a-Form-error\" data-template-id=\"86114112308848946_ET\"></span>\n    <div class=\"t-Form-itemRequired\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Required</div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div></div></div><div class=\"col col-1 apex-col-auto \" ><button onclick=\"apex.submit({request:&#x27;P6_GO&#x27;,validate:true});\" class=\"t-Button t-Button--hot t-Button--small&#x20;t-Button--padTop\" type=\"button\"  id=\"P6_GO\"><span class=\"t-Button-label\">Search</span></button></div><div class=\"col col-9 apex-col-auto col-end\" ><button onclick=\"apex.submit({request:&#x27;P6_RESET&#x27;});\" class=\"t-Button t-Button--hot t-Button--small&#x20;t-Button--padTop\" type=\"button\"  id=\"P6_RESET\"><span class=\"t-Button-label\">Reset</span></button></div>\n</div>\n</div><br /><b>Please note:</b> \nThe evaluation data is posted after all evaluation sheets are processed.<br />\n\n      <div class=\"t-ButtonRegion-buttons\"></div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"t-ButtonRegion-col t-ButtonRegion-col--right\"><div class=\"t-ButtonRegion-buttons\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"row \">\n<div class=\"col col-12 apex-col-auto col-start col-end\" ><div id=\"R107015196988372348\"  role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Instructions\"  class=\"t-IRR-region \">\n    <div class=\"t-Region-orderBy\"></div>\n    \n    <span style=\"color: black;\"><font size=\"3\">To search for an evaluation, please select the <b>department</b>, \n<b>subject</b> and <b>course catalog  number</b>. Then click on the \"<b>Search</b>\" button to proceed.</font>\n<br><br>\nTo search by the semester or instructor's name, click on the link.\n</span>\n<br><br>\n<b><span style=\"color: black;\"><font size=\"3\">NOTE:</b> This\ninformation has been provided to help you in planning and choosing your\ncourses. It is only one source of information that should be used for this\npurpose.&nbsp; We recommend that you also review course syllabi, the additional\ninformation made available via the Hunter online schedule of classes, and talk\nto other students.&nbsp; <br>\n<br>\nWhen interpreting these data please keep in mind the following: </p>\n\n<ul type=disc>\n <li class=MsoNormal style='line-height:normal'>Evaluations can vary widely for the\n     same professor and may even differ across sections of the same course. </li>\n <li class=MsoNormal style='line-height:normal'>Not all students complete an\n     evaluation.&nbsp; Students who have withdrawn from a course or are not\n     present on the day of the evaluation are not included in the calculations.\n     </li>\n <li class=MsoNormal style='line-height:normal'>Ratings for course sections with a\n     small number of respondents are not necessarily as reliable as those based\n     on a larger number of students.</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\nIf the report information\nis not correct, please contact the Faculty/Staff Help Desk by phone: (212) 772-HELP or by email: \n<a href=\"mailto:helpdesk@hunter.cuny.edu?subject=Teacher%20Evaluation%20On-Line%20Reports\">helpdesk@hunter.cuny.edu</a>.</font></span>\n\n    \n    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n      </main>\n      <footer class=\"t-Footer\" id=\"t_Footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n        <div class=\"t-Footer-body\">\n          <div class=\"t-Footer-content\"></div>\n          <div class=\"t-Footer-apex\">\n            <div class=\"t-Footer-version\">Release 1.0 - Built by ICIT - \u00a9 Copyright 2024, 2026, Hunter College. All rights reserved.</div>\n            <div class=\"t-Footer-customize\"></div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"t-Footer-top\">\n          <a href=\"#top\" class=\"t-Footer-topButton\" id=\"t_Footer_topButton\" title=\"Start of page\" aria-label=\"Start of page\"><span class=\"a-Icon icon-up-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a>\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-Body-inlineDialogs\" id=\"t_Body_inlineDialogs\"></div><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"pPageFormRegionChecksums\" valu